1
00:00:00,517 --> 00:00:03,187
(Raj:)I will see you gentlemen later.

2
00:00:08,817 --> 00:00:10,857
(Howard:)She is gonna break his heart.

3
00:00:17,701 --> 00:00:20,991
(Amy:)For someone who has a machine
that can travel anywhere in time...

4
00:00:21,163 --> 00:00:24,793
(Amy:)...Doctor Who sure does have a thing
for modern-day London.

5
00:00:26,251 --> 00:00:29,791
(Sheldon:)Careful. It's that kind of sass
that can get a person uninvited...

6
00:00:29,963 --> 00:00:31,543
(Sheldon:)...to this year's Who Con.

7
00:00:34,509 --> 00:00:37,349
(Penny:)We're not counting this as a date,
are we?

8
00:00:38,054 --> 00:00:44,014
I'm... I'm not sure,
but I think the right answer here is "no."

9
00:00:45,312 --> 00:00:48,102
Bug report: When a guy asks me
to spend time with him...

10
00:00:48,273 --> 00:00:50,233
...he plans
something more interesting...

11
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:52,400
...than hanging out at home,
watching TV.

12
00:00:53,445 --> 00:00:55,405
(Leonard:)Even Doctor Who?

13
00:00:56,364 --> 00:00:58,534
- Even Doctor Who.
All right, that's it.

14
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:03,020
(Sheldon:)Who Con, you're out.

